  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDCS / Durable solutions for vulnerable, conflict and drought effected in Diyala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Objective: Conflict and drought affected communities are supported to move towards Durable Solutions through improved, inclusive, and sustained access to Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services in Diyala. Specific Objectives:  1. Conflict and drought affected people including Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs), returnees, and host community members, have increased and equitable access to safe water and sanitation facilities.  2. Government and community actors have increased thematic and organizational capacity to ensure the provision of quality WASH services.</narrative>
  </description>
